* Synchronous Boost Converter
.tran 1n 5m

Vin in 0 12
L1 in sw 100u
M1 sw 0 gate_lo 0 NMOS W=100u L=1u
M2 out sw gate_hi 0 NMOS W=100u L=1u
C1 out 0 100u
Rload out 0 10

Vgate_lo gate_lo 0 PULSE(0 12 0 1n 1n 4u 10u)
Vgate_hi gate_hi 0 PULSE(12 0 0 1n 1n 4u 10u)

.model NMOS NMOS(Vto=1 Kp=2 Lambda=0)

.end